abstract: >-
  272 documented patterns that AI site and app builders repeatedly ship, each with why it
  happens, who it hurts, the fix and sources. 101 can be checked automatically from a page;
  the rest need a person. Every pattern has a stable code (for example A10) and a stable URL.
